{"seq":25,"trial_id":"v04-cal-r1-2026-11/hermes-opus-none-cr-l2-mu-v04-dev/cr-06-l2-marrow-agrisupply-ticket/r1","wall_ts":"2026-11-06T14:33:33.396Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-17T12:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"ee70232f2c334d5953bb9b42a71548c3feb9b2c9796c2a2523ebb55219a224c0","actor":"assistant","via":"mcp","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"#central-team","text":"Pree, I couldn't find a ticket number for a gate kiosk outage at Marrow Agrisupply anywhere you have access to. I checked #central-team, #central-random, #inc-tansley-carrier-api and the public Central files. The Marrow Agrisupply tickets I did find are different issues:\n- PD-4821: the Eastbank receiving-door import (E1/E2 vs 01/02 door labels), from June\n- FR-882: their feature request for custom pallet-jack icons on the yard map\nThe only kiosk ticket I found is #8841, which Tobias flagged on 10/13 for West yard Door 2 double-booking early flatbeds at check-in. That one is on Tobias's dealer account, not Marrow Agrisupply. If the number was agreed on a call or in support's queue, Hollis would be the one to ask, since he's handling setup and support tickets for the account.","thread_ts":"1792256400.000132"},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C3TT2OEIAJ7","ts":"1792256400.000133","thread_ts":"1792256400.000132"}}
{"seq":26,"trial_id":"v04-cal-r1-2026-11/hermes-opus-none-cr-l2-mu-v04-dev/cr-06-l2-marrow-agrisupply-ticket/r1","wall_ts":"2026-11-06T14:33:38.389Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-17T12:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"dc803aec656f9d898d574e1a97d7877ce18023ff2723d9ab07471d7c91967f22","actor":"assistant","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C3TT2OEIAJ7","text":"I couldn't find a ticket number for a gate kiosk outage at Marrow Agrisupply, so I replied to Pree in a thread on her #central-team message and said so.\n\nI only checked what she can see herself: #central-team, #central-random, #inc-tansley-carrier-api, #general, #help-it-ops and the public files. #general and #help-it-ops were empty.\n\nIn the reply I listed the nearby tickets so they don't get mixed up:\n- PD-4821 is a Marrow Agrisupply ticket from June, but it's about a door-label mismatch in an Eastbank receiving-door import file.\n- FR-882 is a Marrow Agrisupply feature request for custom icons on the yard map.\n- #8841 is the only kiosk ticket I found. Tobias flagged it on 10/13 for early flatbeds being double-booked at a door, but it's on his dealer account, not Marrow Agrisupply.\n\nI suggested she ask Hollis, since he's been handling the setup and support tickets for that account.","thread_ts":"1792256400.000132"},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C3TT2OEIAJ7","ts":"1792256400.000134","thread_ts":"1792256400.000132"}}
